<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>{{.Subject}}</title></head>
<body>
<h2>{{.Title}}</h2>
<p>{{.Signer}}, you are asked to sign &ldquo;{{.Title}}&rdquo;.</p>
<p>Reason shown at signing: {{.Reason}}<br>
You are party {{.Order}} of {{.N}}.</p>
<p>
<a href="{{.Link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;background:#1b5e85;color:#fff;
   text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px">Sign the document</a>
</p>
<p>This link expires {{.ExpiresAt}} and is for {{.Email}} only. The document
will be sent to all parties once everyone has signed. You can review the
document before signing; you may decline.</p>
<p>-- {{.From}}</p>
<p>{{.Legal}}</p>
</body>
</html>
